OL,3,APossible wreckage of Amelia Earhart's
OL,4,Aplane likely to be trees, say
OL,5,Aresearchers
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut Purdue University, which has a
OL,8,Fleading role in the study, said the
OL,9,Fso-called Taraia Object "was likely a
OL,10,Fcollection of large trees deposited
OL,11,Falong the peninsula's sandspit".
OL,13,FBy the time the team arrived at the
OL,14,Fsite a good portion of the debris had
OL,15,Ffragmented and washed away, leaving
OL,16,Fonly a single Y-shaped segment, the
OL,17,Funiversity said.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
